    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   你呢？你刚才直接穿过了法术的正中心吧，总是那么乱来。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "你呢？你刚才直接穿过了法术的正中心吧，总是那么乱来。"
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   噗嗤，我这才发现，怎么把长头发剪短了？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "噗嗤，我这才发现，怎么把长头发剪短了？"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#7\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   喂，你刚刚笑出来了吧！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "喂，你刚刚笑出来了吧！"
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#7\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   头上都沾满了沙子，就算是短发也不能不珍惜啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "头上都沾满了沙子，就算是短发也不能不珍惜啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#3\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   我没事的啦，谢谢。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "我没事的啦，谢谢。"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#3\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   ......谢谢？我们已经这么生疏了吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "......谢谢？我们已经这么生疏了吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
