        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   嗯？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "嗯？"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#3\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   为什么这个时候回来？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "为什么这个时候回来？"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#3\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   唔，嗯，原因是有不少啦，怎么说呢。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "唔，嗯，原因是有不少啦，怎么说呢。"
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   第一，是工作。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "第一，是工作。"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   第二，龙门安魂节总是会搞促销嘛，回龙门凑个热闹。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "第二，龙门安魂节总是会搞促销嘛，回龙门凑个热闹。"
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#3\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   ......那么多年的安魂夜你都不知所踪，偏偏在今年回来？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "......那么多年的安魂夜你都不知所踪，偏偏在今年回来？"
    },
