        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#3\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   很多地方，多到数不清。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "很多地方，多到数不清。"
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   来到一座无人问津的村子，接下一封信，再前往群山的另一面，追着移动城市跑，就这样。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "来到一座无人问津的村子，接下一封信，再前往群山的另一面，追着移动城市跑，就这样。"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#7\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   听着真孤独呢。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "听着真孤独呢。"
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1#7\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[name=\"莫斯提马\"]   但写成游记的话说不定能大卖？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "莫斯提马",
        "content": "但写成游记的话说不定能大卖？"
    },
